adj. 3. much greater than the normal; "abnormal profits"; "abnormal ambition"adv. 1. in an abnormal manner; "they were behaving abnormally"; "his blood pressure was abnormally low"n. 1. any address at which you dwell more than temporarily; "a person can have several residences"
