adj. 1. free from dirt or impurities; or having clean habits; "children with clean shining faces"; "clean white shirts"; "clean dishes"; "a spotlessly clean house"; "cats are clean animals"
adj. 2. free of restrictions or qualifications; "a clean bill of health"; "a clear winner"
